	"lexical": {
		"root": {
			"children": [
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "知り合いから野良猫飼わないかというLINEの連絡に2ヶ月後くらいに気づいて野良猫を我が家にお迎えしました。数日通って膝の上に乗ってくれるようになったくらいでお家に連行。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "家の中の安全だが狭い世界での暮らしと自然豊かな場所での野良生活どっちが幸せなのかはよくわからないけれど、交通量のある道路にも出ていて心配だったのでいったんはよい選択だったと思いたい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/IMG_6788.jpeg",
					"width": 5712,
					"height": 4284,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "お迎え初日は押し入れの中や2階に立てこもり。よくわからん敵に見知らぬところに連れてこられたので無理もない。トイレはちゃんと猫砂にやってくれたので助かった。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/IMG_6682.jpeg",
					"width": 4032,
					"height": 3024,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/IMG_6683.jpeg",
					"width": 4032,
					"height": 3024,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/IMG_6684.jpeg",
					"width": 3024,
					"height": 4032,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/IMG_6685.jpeg",
					"width": 5712,
					"height": 4284,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "3日目、ご飯やトイレの交換はしつつも一定距離を保つ。ちなみに階段から顔を覗かせているときが一番かわいい。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/IMG_6692.jpeg",
					"width": 3024,
					"height": 4032,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "お迎え手順は正直ミスってしまった。お迎え前にケージを買ってその中でしばらく暮らしてもらって安全地帯を管理しやすい場所にしてしまうのが定石っぽかった。ドアの後ろ等の数少ない死角を安全地帯にしてしばらく過ごしていた様子。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
