				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "この段階では2階から1階廊下までは移動するが部屋にはなかなか入ってこない。徐々にテリトリーを増やしていく作戦。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/image-2.png",
					"width": 2048,
					"height": 1536,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "そうこうしているうちに放送大学の面接授業で1泊2日家をあけることになったので急遽トイレ増設。猫のスマート化製品は日々の省力化だけじゃなくて留守にするときに真価を発揮することを理解したのでブラックフライデーで購入を決意した。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/image-3.png",
					"width": 2048,
					"height": 1536,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "そしてついに障子が破れることを学習。下半分はガラスなので大丈夫だけどソファや棚から突破されそう。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/image-4.png",
					"width": 1536,
					"height": 2048,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "最近は室温も一桁になって寒くなってきたのでリビングでファンヒーターを回し始めたのだけど、猫がめちゃくちゃ怖がっててあったかい部屋でなかなか落ち着いてくれない。昔飼ってた猫はファンヒーター大好きだったので、いつかラブラブになってくれると信じて少しずつ慣れさせていく。",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						}
					],
					"direction": "ltr",
					"format": "",
					"indent": 0,
					"type": "paragraph",
					"version": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "image",
					"version": 1,
					"src": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2025/11/image-5.png",
					"width": 1536,
					"height": 2048,
					"title": "",
					"alt": "",
					"caption": "",
					"cardWidth": "regular",
					"href": ""
				},
				{
					"children": [
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "ブラックフライデーでXiaomiの",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						},
						{
							"children": [
								{
									"detail": 0,
									"format": 0,
									"mode": "normal",
									"style": "",
									"text": "スマート給餌器2",
									"type": "extended-text",
									"version": 1
								}
							],
							"direction": "ltr",
							"format": "",
							"indent": 0,
							"type": "link",
							"version": 1,
							"rel": "noreferrer",
							"target": null,
							"title": null,
							"url": "https://amzn.to/3LPEqz0"
						},
						{
							"detail": 0,
							"format": 0,
							"mode": "normal",
							"style": "",
							"text": "と",
							"type": "extended-text",
							"version": 1
						},
						{
							"children": [
								{
									"detail": 0,
									"format": 0,
									"mode": "normal",
									"style": "",
									"text": "スマート給水器2",
									"type": "extended-text",
									"version": 1
								}
